# The fairy-dust glint (#338, D82): a 5x5 aqua-white star drawn ON TOP at the four corners of the
# selected target, from the frame it is selected, so the selection reads even when the hero stands over the target
# or the wall behind is bright. Two frames, the diagonal pairs alternating every 0.25 s. Ink k keeps it readable on pale
# backgrounds. Not the pickup sparkle (warm yellow, one per item, every 2.4 s).
size 5 5
color k 0b0814
color g 7fe0cc
color c f2fff4
frame big
..k..
.kck.
kcgck
.kck.
..k..
frame small
.....
..k..
.kck.
..k..
.....
